//Swagger Mapping
| App requirement                 | API area to investigate                 | Likely endpoints                                              | Tech-lead question                                                                        |
| ------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Sign in / session               | Authentication                          | **Verify in Bootcamp Swagger**                                | What does login return? Access token? Refresh token? Expiration?                          |
| Manager dashboard: weekly sales | Sales Orders                            | `GET /salesOrders`                                            | Is there server-side date filtering, or must we fetch/filter locally?                     |
| Top / bottom products           | Sales Orders + Order Details + Products | `/salesOrders`, `/salesOrders/{id}/details`, `/products/{id}` | Is there an aggregate endpoint, or do we calculate rankings ourselves?                    |
| Low-stock products              | Products + Inventory                    | `/productInventories`, `/products/{id}`                       | Inventory has quantity, while product has reorder point—will this require joining calls?  |
| Employee shifts                 | Employees + Shifts                      | `/shifts` plus employee/history routes                        | Which endpoint actually associates an employee with a shift?                              |
| Employee list                   | Employees                               | **Verify employee routes**                                    | Does employee data include the person's display name directly or require another request? |
| Employee profile                | Employee + Person/detail routes         | Employee/detail endpoints                                     | Which fields are optional?                                                                |
| Product list                    | Products                                | `GET /products`                                               | Pagination? Search/filter query parameters?                                               |
| Product details                 | Products                                | `GET /products/{productId}` or `/details`                     | Which nullable fields need graceful UI handling?                                          |
| Inventory by location           | Product Inventories                     | `GET /productInventories`                                     | Does response contain location data or location ID only?                                  |
| Customer/store orders           | Sales Orders                            | `GET /salesOrders`                                            | How do we distinguish store versus individual/customer orders?                            |
| Order details                   | Sales Order Details                     | `/salesOrders/{id}/details`                                   | Are product names embedded or fetched separately?                                         |
| Search/sort/filter              | Several collections                     | Swagger query parameters                                      | Which operations can happen server-side?                                                  |
| Inventory editing               | Product Inventory                       | **Look for PUT/PATCH**                                        | Does the deployed API permit updates?                                                     |
| Employee editing                | Employees                               | **Look for PUT/PATCH**                                        | Which employee fields are writable?                                                       |
| Token renewal                   | Authentication                          | **Look for refresh endpoint**                                 | Does the API issue refresh tokens at all?                                                 |
| Offline caching                 | Client-side                             | No API requirement                                            | What data is safe/useful to persist?                                                      |
